   near-black stone surfaces, an orange (#fe6e00) accent, warm-gray muted ink,
   and mono eyebrow labels. The categorical --s1..--s8 slots are the chart
   palette (data colors, kept distinct from the brand accent). */

:root {
  --page:        #0a0a0a;
